rsucker_2096a7df-e054-4d2d-a741-d3e71629388a.png?v=1779979237&width=80)\n![Shorts](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/Shorts_86f84c6e-6532-47d6-a65e-0603b2f196d5.png?v=1779974168&width=80)\n![Women's Pants](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/Weomenswear.png?v=1779979187&width=80)\n![All Custom-made Pants](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/Rectangle_2160.png?v=1779973435&width=80)\n![Workwear](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/workwear.png?v=1779974159&width=80)\n![Smart Casuals](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/smart_casual.png?v=1779978851&width=80)\n![Travel & Outdoor](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/Travel_7f526e49-5382-46c1-ac82-ca62e405eb9a.png?v=1779975799&width=80)\n![Casuals](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/Casuals.png?v=1779978931&width=80)\n![Special Occasions](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/Special_Occasions.png?v=1779978997&width=80)\n![Gift Cards  NEW](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/PhysicalGiftcard1.png?v=1787521464&width=80)\n\n### Your cart is empty\n\n![](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/formals_-_Cart_adbebd7d-1096-4626-b122-7c6dba2b6635.png?v=1765132247&width=800)\n\nShop Formals\n\n![](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/Jeans_-_empty_cart_banner.png?v=1773826959&width=800)\n\nShop Jeans\n\n![](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/Chinos_-_cart.png?v=1773430428&width=800)\n\nShop Chinos\n\n![](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/power-stretch_-_cart_4ced0a51-a415-44b5-b50b-201b92297388.png?v=1773430427&width=800)\n\nShop Power-Stretch\n\nBuy any 2 Custom-Made pants, save 15%  \n*Not valid on discounted products*\n\nBuy any 3 Custom-Made pants, save 25%  \n*Not valid on discounted products*\n\nBuy any 5+ Custom-Made pants, save 30%*Not valid on discounted products*\n\nSave 15% on your first Custom-Made order  \n*Not valid on discounted products*\n\n##### Travel Pants\n\n![]()\n![]()\n\nJapan•ease Pleated Trousers\n\n##### Linen Pants\n\n![]()\n![]()\n\nPants Bundle\n\n##### Track My Order\n\n![]()\n![]()\n\nPants Customisation Guide\n\n##### Our Story\n\n![]()\n![]()\n\nSustainability\n\n##### Store Locator\n\n![]()\n![]()\n\nOur New Store\n\nKammanahalli, Bangalore\n\n![The Pant Project ](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/Tpp_Horizontal_logo_7f559ce4-7ff9-4d8d-97fd-038eb7fa7580.svg?v=1737449629&width=230)\n\n# The Pant Project Store - Borivali, Mumbai Details\n\n![](https://cdn.shopify.com/extensions/019fd0b5-1011-7034-a269-cb491143f5dc/omni-storelocator-app-2-308/assets/back.png)\n\n# The Pant Project stores near me\n\nSubscribe to our newsletter get **15% off** on your first custom-made order, access to exclusive deals, and more.\n\nAanswr Fashion Pvt Ltd.  \nThe Pant Project, Lawrence & Mayo House, 4th Floor, Dr Dadabhai Naoroji Rd, Fort, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400001\n\ncontact@pantproject.com  \n+918657735200\n\nAanswr Fashion Pvt Ltd.  \nThe Pant Project, Lawrence & Mayo House, 4th Floor, Dr Dadabhai Naoroji Rd, Fort, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400001\n\ncontact@pantproject.com  \n+918657735200\n\nSubscribe to our newsletter get **15% off** on your first custom-made order, access to exclusive deals, and more.\n\n![](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/tpp_logo.svg?v=1727940483&width=614)\n![](//pantproject.com/cdn/shop/files/tpp_logo.svg?v=1727940483&width=614)\n\n#### Cities Served\n\n### [[[name]]]([[&url]])\n\n## [[name]]\n\n### [[[name]]]([[&url]])","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/popular/pant-project-borivali","title":"Pant Project Borivali","raw_content":"[Log In](/accounts/login/?next=%2Fpopular%2Fpant-project-borivali&source=desktop_nav)\n\n[Sign Up](/accounts/emailsignup/)\n\n# Pant Project Borivali\n\nThe Pant Project opened its flagship store in Borivali West, Mumbai at Shop No. 14, Madhav Kunj Apartment A-Wing, Chamunda Circle, Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel Rd. The store offers custom-fit formal... more\n\n## [borivali](/popular/borivali/?utm_source=topic_pill)\n\n## [pants project](/popular/pants-project/?utm_source=topic_pill)\n\n## [pant project pants](/popular/pant-project-pants/?utm_source=topic_pill)\n\n## [the pant project store borivali mumbai](/popular/the-pant-project-store-borivali-mumbai/?utm_source=topic_pill)\n\n## [the pant project borivali](/popular/the-pant-project-borivali/?utm_source=topic_pill)\n\n[1.5M\n\nSend this to your friend 😒😒 I took my friend at the @thepantproject - Borivali store, but you can visit any store available in Mumbai, Pune, Bengaluru, Kochi, Hyderabad, Ahmedabad, Indore and Chandigarh. #friend #pant](/reel/DVshlwjjJ3H/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n\n[29.5K\n\n✨ BORIVALI WEST, This One’s Built Different! 📍Shimpoli Road | 3BHK | 1453 ft ✔️ 11 ft. Floor-to-Ceiling Height – You’ll feel the difference the moment you walk in ✔️ Huge Living Room – Bigger than most 4BHKs in the area 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Only 10 families in the entire building – Your privacy, your peace ✔️ Low-Density Project on a quiet, tree-lined street 🌳 Quiet location, prime connectivity – Tucked away, yet close to everything Location USP 📍 Borivali Link Road 2 mins 📍 Borivali SV Road 4 mins 📍 Borivali Railway station 5-6 mins 📍 Shimpoli Metro station 3 mins 📞 Call [7304062862] – This one’s limited & exclusive #borivaliwest #4bhk #realestate #borivali #3bhk](/reel/DV_DyPuCIZ6/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n\n[964\n\nBorivali is rising—and so is your opportunity to be part of a landmark lifestyle. ✨ With Samarpan Rajdeep by Samarpan Homes & Developers, the skyline of Mumbai’s western suburbs is being redefined. This project isn’t just about construction; it’s about creating a future where modern living meets convenience, connectivity, and community. From premium residences to thoughtful design, every detail reflects a vision built to last. As Borivali continues to grow as a hub of culture, commerce, and comfort, Samarpan Rajdeep stands tall as a symbol of progress and pride. Secure your future today and be part of this transformation. 📞 Contact: +91 9321461391 🌐 Explore more: www.samarpanhomes.com SamarpanRajdeep #BorivaliIsRising #MumbaiRealEstateInvestment #LuxuryHomesMumbai #FutureReadyLivingSpaces](/reel/DVp8tM2iq9V/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n\n[16.8K\n\nFastest Growing Project in Borivali East!\\* \\*🏗️ Recent Progress:\\* ✅Nearing Possession ✅RCC Structure Completed ✅ Bank Approvals Secured 💰 ✅ Exclusive ICICI Bank Finance Scheme \\*💰 Best Deals on 1 & 2 BHK Homes!\\* \\*🏡 RERA Carpet Area & Prices:\\* ✔ 1 BHK – ₹91L++ ✔ 2 BHK – ₹1.57Cr++ \\*🚆 Strategic Location - Everything Within Minutes!\\* 🔹 WEH & Metro – 7 mins 🔹 Borivali East (Platform 1) – 5 mins 🔹 Borivali East (Platform 9) – 10 mins 🔹 SV Road – 5 mins | Link Road – 9 mins \\*🌿 Unbeatable Features:\\* ✅ Rooftop Garden & Premium Amenities ✅ 2 Beautiful Gardens Beside the Project #reels #viral #instagram #property #reelsinstagram](/reel/DUGROWKiHNu/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n\n[194K\n\nBottomwear that works as hard as you do 👖✨ The Pant Project is now in Borivali — bringing perfect fits, endless styles, and everyday comfort under one roof!!!! [Shop No. 14, Madhav Kunj Apartment A-Wing, Chamunda Circle, Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel Rd, Mandapeshwar, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400092] #ThePantProject #borivalilaunch #trouser #mensfashion #mensgrooming #tailoredtoperfection](/reel/DOvlLMyjADY/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n\n[619\n\nDreaming of a new home but unsure where to invest? 🏠 Redevelopment offers the perfect solution – prime location, great connectivity, modern design, and superior facilities✨ For Borivali IC Colony, Project Alfa by @the\\_green\\_venturez\\_group is the smart choice🌿 Grab your chance to live in comfort and style today! 🏡 📞Contact no: +91 97699 97688 . . . . . #greenventurezgroup #borivali #redevelopment #projectalfa #dreamhome [real estate development, redevelopment projects, construction expertise, urban infrastructure, project planning, feasibility analysis]](/reel/DV76iydjTLp/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n\n[40.5K\n\n8591190742 ☎️97694 51809 ▫️ \\*3 BHK – ₹3.70 Cr++ (2 Car Parks)\\* -(1137CA/1240CA) ▫️ \\*6BHK – ₹8.70 Cr++